I’d like to talk about a long journey I had with my mother to Ha Giang about two years ago.

At that time, I had just finished all my exams, so I really wanted to go on a trip to relax. I thought it would be even more meaningful if I could travel with my mother. She has always dreamed of visiting places with unspoiled natural beauty, so after doing some research, I decided that Ha Giang would be a perfect destination.

To get there, we first traveled to Noi Bai International Airport, which took about two hours, and then we took a sleeper bus to Ha Giang. It was quite a long journey, but it was also interesting because we could enjoy the changing scenery along the way.

We stayed there for three days and had a wonderful time together. During the day, we visited famous attractions, explored the mountains, and took lots of photos to keep as memories. In the evening, we went to local markets, tried regional food, and interacted with local people, which was a really eye-opening experience.

I really enjoyed this journey because it gave me a chance to spend quality time with my mother. She has devoted so much of her life to taking care of our family, so this trip was a meaningful way for me to show my appreciation. Overall, it was a memorable and emotional experience that I will never forget.
